dsh-mimo-extension README · 附：fnOS 网关部署：平台只给官方客户端模块（`dsh-client-connection` / `dsh-api-gateway` / `dsh-client-hmr` / `dsh-client-file-upload` / `dsh-client-ui-deliverables` / `dsh-session-log-export`）用 `patch-dsh.mjs` 打前缀补丁，第三方插件必须自己处理。本插件的 `gatewayPath()`：

```js
function gatewayPath(path) {
  let prefix = "";
  try {
